    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450310/extras/7a39282653898f6ce28f4f47acf26531.avif?t=1729006277\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450310/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1729006277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450310/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1729006277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450310/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1729006277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Made for you to relax, be inspired and have fun!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450310/extras/9757bed39d7c86ef52ac496101ad713a.poster.avif?t=1729006277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450310/extras/9757bed39d7c86ef52ac496101ad713a.webm?t=1729006277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Be amazed by the minimalist style and beautiful art of this game!<br>The arts of Hidden Shapes - Animals are inspired by the animal world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450310/extras/f64d7582634d7493ad214018eb1b05f1.avif?t=1729006277\" /></div><br><br>Relax with these beautiful hand-drawn jigsaw puzzles and forget about your worries by enchanting yourself and observing the power of life in nature!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450310/extras/c25f242552f48adbb1ad7a8e3a5a9f51.poster.avif?t=1729006277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450310/extras/c25f242552f48adbb1ad7a8e3a5a9f51.webm?t=1729006277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>So that you can have fun and enjoy the game more, after solving a puzzle the complete art will be released, so at any time you can have fun again solving the entire puzzle.<br><br><strong><u>\u2022 Steam Community</u></strong><br><br>Be sure to follow us on the Steam Page, so you'll find out about new games and news from the studio.",
